I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so the world has no filesystem and no HTTP import. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need authority this node doesn't hold. If operations needs them, the graph's `with` clause has to grant those capabilities first.

